{"meta":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"ticksRequested":n:40c0e00000000000,"founders":null,"engine":s:"emergence-engine.js","engineVersion":s:"2.6.0",},"events":[{"id":n:0000000000000000,"tick":n:0000000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"start","txt":s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: <b>Eira</b>, <b>Ask</b>, <b>Embla</b>, <b>Torv</b>. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",},{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"tick":n:401c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📖 <b>Eira</b> told the day back as a story worth remembering — <b>Eira's the tale</b> (Storytelling) has been invented! <i>The first culture — memory shaped into meaning.</i>","tech":s:"storytelling","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:4040000000000000,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4000000000000000,"tick":n:4024000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4008000000000000,"tick":n:402e000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c5ecb3cdf999a,"y":n:403fc2b60130cccd,},{"id":n:4010000000000000,"tick":n:4030000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40486ef7bf61fa16,"y":n:40439d55c9bb2322,},{"id":n:4014000000000000,"tick":n:4042800000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Ask</b> rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder — <b>Ask's ember</b> (Fire) has been invented! <i>Warmth at night. Opens the path to pottery and smithing.</i>","tech":s:"fire","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b5d08e6f545a9,"y":n:4040321a89c36cd5,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4018000000000000,"tick":n:4042800000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ask</b> was known as <b>Ask the Firebringer</b>.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b5d08e6f545a9,"y":n:4040321a89c36cd5,},{"id":n:401c000000000000,"tick":n:4042800000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask</b> began believing the world repeats and can be understood — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Knowing Eye)</i>","custom":s:"c1","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404b5d08e6f545a9,"y":n:4040321a89c36cd5,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4020000000000000,"tick":n:4050400000000000,"day":n:4008000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4022000000000000,"tick":n:4050400000000000,"day":n:4008000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that the stars and seasons turn on a fixed wheel. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"starsWheel","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4047a1e8f6f07505,"y":n:403bd07aa93a27b5,},{"id":n:4024000000000000,"tick":n:4056000000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask the Firebringer</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404bac5c29ac45ac,"y":n:403daa083c5f4011,},{"id":n:4026000000000000,"tick":n:4056c00000000000,"day":n:4014000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira</b> began believing the lights above are the fires of the first people, still watching — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(the Star-Herd)</i>","custom":s:"c2","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045c38fa25cdb6d,"y":n:403b3df754855ae7,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4028000000000000,"tick":n:4056c00000000000,"day":n:4014000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 <b>Eira</b> saw a pattern in the stars and gave it a name — <b>the Star-Herd</b>. From watching, a cosmology is born: the first faith of the sky.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"label":s:"A RELIGION OF THE SKY",},{"id":n:402a000000000000,"tick":n:405b800000000000,"day":n:4014000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪢 <b>Eira</b> twisted grass fibers into something strong — <b>Eira's cord</b> (Rope) has been invented! <i>Makes it possible to bind parts together.</i>","tech":s:"rope","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045d4b2c8d3712e,"y":n:403c037d2c6f64b6,"causes":[],},{"id":n:402c000000000000,"tick":n:405bc00000000000,"day":n:4014000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4044dea8001d3821,"y":n:403d37054f2242cf,},{"id":n:402e000000000000,"tick":n:405d000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ The first winter has come. The world turns white and hard, and the nights grow long. Fire is no longer comfort — it is life.",},{"id":n:4030000000000000,"tick":n:405d400000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎨 <b>Eira</b> ground coloured earth and left an image on the wall — <b>Eira's pigmentwork</b> (Painting) has been invented! <i>The world seen, kept and shared — visual art is born.</i>","tech":s:"painting","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045d4b2c8d3712e,"y":n:403c037d2c6f64b6,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:4031000000000000,"tick":n:405d400000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira</b> began painting a mark on a flat stone when something new is made — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Painting a mark on a flat stone)</i>","custom":s:"c3","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045d4b2c8d3712e,"y":n:403c037d2c6f64b6,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4032000000000000,"tick":n:4061a00000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧶 <b>Eira</b> crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame — <b>Eira's the loom</b> (Weaving) has been invented! <i>Cloth for warmth and trade — and hands that specialize.</i>","tech":s:"weaving","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40454542e28abc75,"y":n:403c5cd5da421313,"causes":[s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4033000000000000,"tick":n:4061c00000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Eira's cord. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4034000000000000,"tick":n:4062400000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that rubbing wood makes heat. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"frictionHeat","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044ced3f27341b8,"y":n:403d587f3442e2a6,},{"id":n:4035000000000000,"tick":n:4063a00000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that a bent branch fights to spring back. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"branchBends","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045121727b6a81e,"y":n:403dc5423db015da,},{"id":n:4036000000000000,"tick":n:4067800000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:4037000000000000,"tick":n:406a600000000000,"day":n:4024000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask the Firebringer</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4038000000000000,"tick":n:406f800000000000,"day":n:4026000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Eira</b> and <b>Ask</b> have had a child, <b>Liv</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40465d702957c98d,"y":n:403d18df131d6422,"causes":[s:"agent:1",s:"agent:2",],},{"id":n:4039000000000000,"tick":n:4070300000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎵 <b>Eira</b> found that a struck string and a voice could ring together — <b>Eira's melody</b> (Music) has been invented! <i>Song at the fire — the root of every art to come.</i>","tech":s:"song","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40465d702957c98d,"y":n:403d18df131d6422,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:403a000000000000,"tick":n:4070400000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:403b000000000000,"tick":n:4072f00000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:403c000000000000,"tick":n:4078c00000000000,"day":n:4031000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:403d000000000000,"tick":n:4079400000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:403e000000000000,"tick":n:407a900000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's cord. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:403f000000000000,"tick":n:407b000000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4040000000000000,"tick":n:407bc00000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Sten</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4043f25f1c570fc1,"y":n:403d70c06c595b2e,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4040800000000000,"tick":n:407c100000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:4041000000000000,"tick":n:407e600000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Ask the Firebringer</b> starved to death.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404937bb4efb3eca,"y":n:403b1a3fcbd34b69,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4041800000000000,"tick":n:407ef00000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Sten</b> noticed that struck stone breaks into sharp shards. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sharpShards","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4043f25f1c570fc1,"y":n:403d70c06c595b2e,},{"id":n:4042000000000000,"tick":n:407f900000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔪 <b>Eira</b> struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard — <b>Eira's knife</b> (Sharpened stone) has been invented! <i>Faster gathering of everything.</i>","tech":s:"sharp","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044b670224dce78,"y":n:403ef11962205f6d,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4042800000000000,"tick":n:4080b00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Eira</b> lashed a sharp point to a long shaft — <b>Eira's javelin</b> (Spear) has been invented! <i>Humans are prey no longer. Deer can be hunted — food even in winter.</i>","tech":s:"spear","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404642f39066ef61,"y":n:403caa5f923e640c,"causes":[s:"ev:36",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4043000000000000,"tick":n:4080b00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Eira</b> was known as <b>Eira the Spearmaker</b>.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404642f39066ef61,"y":n:403caa5f923e640c,},{"id":n:4043800000000000,"tick":n:4080e80000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪓 <b>Eira</b> bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft — <b>Eira's hewer</b> (Axe) has been invented! <i>Twice as fast logging. Required to build huts.</i>","tech":s:"axe","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404642f39066ef61,"y":n:403caa5f923e640c,"causes":[s:"ev:36",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4044000000000000,"tick":n:4081200000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4044800000000000,"tick":n:4081680000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Eira</b> raised logs against each other into a shelter — <b>Eira's shelter</b> (Hut) has been invented! <i>Shelter and warmth at night. Three huts close together become a village.</i>","tech":s:"hut","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40455890f6e1cd8f,"y":n:403f0e0be3e4d177,"causes":[s:"ev:39",],},{"id":n:4045000000000000,"tick":n:4081b80000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛞 <b>Eira</b> watched a log roll and understood something great — <b>Eira's pulley</b> (The Wheel) has been invented! <i>The foundation of mills, carts — and everything that spins.</i>","tech":s:"wheel","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40452975959200c2,"y":n:403ec7b1cb9e6b11,"causes":[s:"ev:39",],},{"id":n:4045800000000000,"tick":n:4082000000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4046000000000000,"tick":n:4082380000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏹 <b>Eira</b> bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back — <b>Eira's birchbow</b> (Bow) has been invented! <i>The hunt no longer needs closeness. Deer fall at a distance.</i>","tech":s:"bow","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045549d800000c2,"y":n:403fc6efbbc6d177,"causes":[s:"ev:37",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4046800000000000,"tick":n:4085a00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4047000000000000,"tick":n:4085c00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that fire makes the heavy ore sweat metal. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"oreMelts","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:4044e622cfd70896,"y":n:403e4cc2756b5d30,},{"id":n:4047800000000000,"tick":n:4086000000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Eira</b> placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone — <b>Eira's urn</b> (Pottery) has been invented! <i>Food can be stored — hunger bites less.</i>","tech":s:"pottery","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40450ca6eb5a1a51,"y":n:403ef2bb95ae98ca,"causes":[s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:4048000000000000,"tick":n:4086480000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that stones grind seed to flour. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"stonesGrind","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404460478f760896,"y":n:403e1543728b5d2f,},{"id":n:4048800000000000,"tick":n:4086800000000000,"day":n:403f000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4049000000000000,"tick":n:4086a00000000000,"day":n:403f000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4049800000000000,"tick":n:4087400000000000,"day":n:4040000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Eira the Spearmaker</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:404a000000000000,"tick":n:4087700000000000,"day":n:4040000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Eira</b> built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire — <b>Eira's burnoven</b> (Kiln) has been invented! <i>Heat enough to melt what hides in ore and sand.</i>","tech":s:"kiln","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:5",s:"ev:47",],},{"id":n:404a800000000000,"tick":n:4087a80000000000,"day":n:4040000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Eira</b> pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited — <b>Eira's tilling</b> (Farming) has been invented! <i>Food that returns every year. The village roots itself.</i>","tech":s:"farming","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:47",],},{"id":n:404b000000000000,"tick":n:4087c00000000000,"day":n:4040000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Eira the Spearmaker</b> has turned the soil — the valley's first field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046000000000000,"y":n:403d000000000000,},{"id":n:404b800000000000,"tick":n:4087e80000000000,"day":n:4040800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📜 <b>Eira</b> carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner — <b>Eira's script</b> (Writing) has been invented! <i>Knowledge spreads to all — and to generations to come.</i>","tech":s:"writing","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:47",],},{"id":n:404c000000000000,"tick":n:4088200000000000,"day":n:4040800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏚️ <b>Eira</b> built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring — <b>Eira's grain store</b> (Granary) has been invented! <i>Surplus survives winter — the first true wealth.</i>","tech":s:"granary","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:53",s:"ev:47",],},{"id":n:404c800000000000,"tick":n:4088580000000000,"day":n:4040800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧠 <b>Eira</b> asked not what the world is but why, and wrote it down — <b>Eira's the argument</b> (Philosophy) has been invented! <i>Reasoned thought — the seed of law, science and doubt.</i>","tech":s:"philosophy","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:55",],},{"id":n:404d000000000000,"tick":n:4088900000000000,"day":n:4041000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎼 <b>Eira</b> wrote music down so a song could outlive its singer — <b>Eira's the score</b> (Composition) has been invented! <i>Music made lasting and grand — the composer, the choir, the hall.</i>","tech":s:"composition","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046593d5a07744c,"y":n:403e65fb4a5d9883,"causes":[s:"ev:25",s:"ev:55",],},{"id":n:404d800000000000,"tick":n:4089e80000000000,"day":n:4041800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🫙 <b>Eira</b> melted sand and found something transparent — <b>Eira's clearstone</b> (Glass) has been invented! <i>A material no one could have imagined.</i>","tech":s:"glass","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044ee27a49952e4,"y":n:4035ded4a06387f8,"causes":[s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:404e000000000000,"tick":n:408a200000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404e800000000000,"tick":n:408a980000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Torv</b> built a hut.","x":n:4045c1653f5c2c73,"y":n:4042ae6e37ac2989,},{"id":n:404f000000000000,"tick":n:408ac00000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40464b9f31193fcc,"y":n:40385ca25cad0058,},{"id":n:404f800000000000,"tick":n:408b380000000000,"day":n:4042800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's pigmentwork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4050000000000000,"tick":n:408b700000000000,"day":n:4042800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Eira the Spearmaker</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4050400000000000,"tick":n:408d100000000000,"day":n:4044000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Eira</b> fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true — <b>Eira's mudbrick</b> (Brick) has been invented! <i>Walls that outlast weather — the start of building.</i>","tech":s:"brick","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404364c7ff1d8a13,"y":n:403dcd70f18c54df,"causes":[s:"ev:47",s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4050800000000000,"tick":n:408d900000000000,"day":n:4044000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛵ <b>Torv</b> stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work — <b>Torv's the boat</b> (Sailing) has been invented! <i>Rivers and coasts become roads — trade and migration by water.</i>","tech":s:"sailing","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:4045504a9c985fa2,"y":n:4044873a2f922988,"causes":[s:"ev:18",s:"ev:39",],},{"id":n:4050c00000000000,"tick":n:408db00000000000,"day":n:4044000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🕳️ <b>Eira</b> lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water — <b>Eira's draw-well</b> (Well) has been invented! <i>Water without walking to the river — a village can grow inland.</i>","tech":s:"well","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404227d8d0fbba5d,"y":n:403fd030fd678c88,"causes":[s:"ev:65",],},{"id":n:4051000000000000,"tick":n:408e180000000000,"day":n:4044800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚪ <b>Eira</b> smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone — <b>Eira's white metal</b> (Tin) has been invented! <i>Useless alone — everything when married to copper.</i>","tech":s:"tin","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4041b5f335ac42c7,"y":n:403e44d91dc3887a,"causes":[s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4051400000000000,"tick":n:408e880000000000,"day":n:4044800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Ylva</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:40445f513bf5c608,"y":n:404514fbb2baf657,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4051800000000000,"tick":n:408ea00000000000,"day":n:4045000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4051c00000000000,"tick":n:408ff00000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that things can be counted, matched and made equal. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"weightsBalance","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40449b2f9cbb6e2b,"y":n:403ef0178676fee7,},{"id":n:4052000000000000,"tick":n:40901c0000000000,"day":n:4046000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚫ <b>Eira</b> found the black stone burns hotter than any wood — <b>Eira's coalcraft</b> (Coal) has been invented! <i>Heat enough for steel and, one day, engines.</i>","tech":s:"coal","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40449b2f9cbb6e2b,"y":n:403ef0178676fee7,"causes":[s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4052400000000000,"tick":n:4090dc0000000000,"day":n:4047000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4052800000000000,"tick":n:4091900000000000,"day":n:4048000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4052c00000000000,"tick":n:4092280000000000,"day":n:4048800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Eira</b> dressed and fitted stone so it stood without mortar — <b>Eira's the mason</b> (Masonry) has been invented! <i>Buildings that outlive their builders — the seed of monuments.</i>","tech":s:"masonry","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044fa55e6e547f5,"y":n:403c41c2c586e98e,"causes":[s:"ev:65",],},{"id":n:4053000000000000,"tick":n:4092340000000000,"day":n:4048800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Eira the Spearmaker</b> and <b>Embla</b> struck a fair trade.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044fa55e6e547f5,"y":n:403c41c2c586e98e,},{"id":n:4053400000000000,"tick":n:4092480000000000,"day":n:4049000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔢 <b>Eira</b> matched pebble to sheep and found number itself — <b>Eira's the count</b> (Counting) has been invented! <i>The world made countable — trade, calendars and mathematics begin.</i>","tech":s:"numbers","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044fa55e6e547f5,"y":n:403c41c2c586e98e,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4053800000000000,"tick":n:4092640000000000,"day":n:4049000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📅 <b>Eira</b> counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days — <b>Eira's the calendar</b> (Calendar) has been invented! <i>The future made plannable — harvest, festival and rite find their day.</i>","tech":s:"calendar","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044fa55e6e547f5,"y":n:403c41c2c586e98e,"causes":[s:"ev:77",],},{"id":n:4053c00000000000,"tick":n:4092b00000000000,"day":n:4049800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛤️ <b>Eira</b> laid stone in a bed so carts ran true in any weather — <b>Eira's trackway</b> (Road) has been invented! <i>Villages bound together — trade, news and armies move.</i>","tech":s:"road","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40449af1b42d47f5,"y":n:403c7b718cfe8328,"causes":[s:"ev:42",s:"ev:75",],},{"id":n:4054000000000000,"tick":n:4092b40000000000,"day":n:4049800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that stones grind seed to flour. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"stonesGrind","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40449af1b42d47f5,"y":n:403c7b718cfe8328,},{"id":n:4054400000000000,"tick":n:4092cc0000000000,"day":n:4049800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's birchbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4054800000000000,"tick":n:4093380000000000,"day":n:404a000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Eira</b> let the wheel drive stones that ground grain — <b>Eira's gristmill</b> (Mill) has been invented! <i>The village can process food — famine recedes.</i>","tech":s:"mill","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4044e9729bb334fa,"y":n:403fbcaaaa79c0ab,"causes":[s:"ev:42",],},{"id":n:4054c00000000000,"tick":n:4093b40000000000,"day":n:404a800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira</b> began planting a seed by the fallen prey — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Planting a seed by the fallen prey)</i>","custom":s:"c4","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40455fcd33135bf5,"y":n:403d60bed6386b47,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4055000000000000,"tick":n:4093b80000000000,"day":n:404a800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Embla</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4055400000000000,"tick":n:4093d00000000000,"day":n:404b000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4055800000000000,"tick":n:4093d40000000000,"day":n:404b000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏛️ <b>Eira</b> raised the arch, and space opened under stone — <b>Eira's the vault</b> (Architecture) has been invented! <i>Temples, halls and towers — the shape of a civilization made visible.</i>","tech":s:"architecture","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404517a5c4ee5bf5,"y":n:403cfcc60f866b47,"causes":[s:"ev:75",],},{"id":n:4055c00000000000,"tick":n:40945c0000000000,"day":n:404b800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌉 <b>Eira</b> carried water across the valley on arches of stone — <b>Eira's the channel</b> (Aqueduct) has been invented! <i>Cities freed from the river — population without limit of the well.</i>","tech":s:"aqueduct","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40448f873e117002,"y":n:403ce74c1f471a7d,"causes":[s:"ev:86",s:"ev:67",],},{"id":n:4056000000000000,"tick":n:4095400000000000,"day":n:404c800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40443db34339ab62,"y":n:40406bd831a86263,},{"id":n:4056400000000000,"tick":n:4095700000000000,"day":n:404d000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira</b> learned which leaves ease pain and close a wound — <b>Eira's herb-lore</b> (Medicine) has been invented! <i>Death held off a while — the healer becomes needed.</i>","tech":s:"medicine","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404518a7809f5748,"y":n:403319624a1dfd27,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4056800000000000,"tick":n:4095900000000000,"day":n:404d000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚖️ <b>Eira</b> wrote the customs down so all were judged by one measure — <b>Eira's the code</b> (Law) has been invented! <i>Custom hardened into law — the institution of justice.</i>","tech":s:"law","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4045523c1abc8e9e,"y":n:40331662824366f4,"causes":[s:"ev:55",s:"ev:77",],},{"id":n:4056c00000000000,"tick":n:40959c0000000000,"day":n:404d000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's pulley. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"wheel",},{"id":n:4057000000000000,"tick":n:4095fc0000000000,"day":n:404d800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that clear glass bends light and makes the small large. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"lensBends","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4047190282ee0c66,"y":n:40329d2c5aa82758,},{"id":n:4057400000000000,"tick":n:4096100000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4057800000000000,"tick":n:4096180000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that two soft metals poured together wake up hard. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"bronzeHard","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:40426b9a03c7039b,"y":n:403d92ae50f808ed,},{"id":n:4057c00000000000,"tick":n:4096400000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🫧 <b>Eira</b> blew molten sand into clear vessels thin as a bubble — <b>Eira's blown glass</b> (Glassblowing) has been invented! <i>Windows, flasks and, one day, lenses.</i>","tech":s:"glassblowing","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:4046fe430adda54e,"y":n:40337d46d5fff1da,"causes":[s:"ev:59",s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4058000000000000,"tick":n:4096800000000000,"day":n:404e800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4058400000000000,"tick":n:4097a00000000000,"day":n:4050000000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Eira's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4058800000000000,"tick":n:4098500000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4058c00000000000,"tick":n:4098880000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Embla</b> built a hut.","x":n:404472ea3b910a58,"y":n:403d3de2ed96177b,},{"id":n:4059000000000000,"tick":n:4098f80000000000,"day":n:4050c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Eira</b> let a twisted line sink where the fish gather — <b>Eira's the net</b> (Fishing) has been invented! <i>The water becomes a larder — food even when the land gives little.</i>","tech":s:"fishing","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404a6fcf18ef8636,"y":n:40312d3ba4b99d3a,"causes":[s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4059400000000000,"tick":n:40990c0000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Eira's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:4059800000000000,"tick":n:409a640000000000,"day":n:4051c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4059c00000000000,"tick":n:409a900000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405a000000000000,"tick":n:409cd00000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405a400000000000,"tick":n:409d400000000000,"day":n:4053c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:405a800000000000,"tick":n:409d600000000000,"day":n:4053c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Embla</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4051000000000000,"y":n:4033000000000000,},{"id":n:405ac00000000000,"tick":n:409e300000000000,"day":n:4054400000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's burnoven. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:405b000000000000,"tick":n:409ef80000000000,"day":n:4054c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40497ece5dd64087,"y":n:403221fcae5df06e,},{"id":n:405b400000000000,"tick":n:409f100000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405b800000000000,"tick":n:409f800000000000,"day":n:4055400000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:405bc00000000000,"tick":n:40a00c0000000000,"day":n:4055800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:405c000000000000,"tick":n:40a05c0000000000,"day":n:4056000000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Eira's hewer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:405c400000000000,"tick":n:40a0a80000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will deci