0000,"x":n:404a838a62fd9a72,"y":n:4031d0a4972f5fe6,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4075200000000000,"tick":n:40b92f0000000000,"day":n:4070d00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Torv</b> does it differently: humming by the fire as the light fades instead of drumming under the old tree as the light fades. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c8",},{"id":n:4075300000000000,"tick":n:40b9340000000000,"day":n:4070e00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4075400000000000,"tick":n:40b9470000000000,"day":n:4070e00000000000,"year":n:4046800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga</b> and <b>Sten</b> have had a child, <b>Ronja</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4033000000000000,"x":n:404ff0865bcbf699,"y":n:40379ad7fc2b6009,"causes":[s:"agent:9",s:"agent:6",],},{"id":n:4075500000000000,"tick":n:40b9580000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Halvar</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:402c000000000000,"x":n:404d800000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:4075600000000000,"tick":n:40b9580000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Vidar</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:404e800000000000,"y":n:4037000000000000,},{"id":n:4075700000000000,"tick":n:40b95d0000000000,"day":n:4070f00000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Eira's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4075800000000000,"tick":n:40b9680000000000,"day":n:4071000000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Idun</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404a800000000000,"y":n:403c000000000000,},{"id":n:4075900000000000,"tick":n:40b97a0000000000,"day":n:4071100000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4075a00000000000,"tick":n:40b9920000000000,"day":n:4071200000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🟤 <b>Saga</b> coaxed a soft red metal out of green stone in the kiln — <b>Saga's the soft metal</b> (Copper) has been invented! <i>The first metal — soft, but the door to bronze.</i>","tech":s:"copper","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:4051bcb4742bd2a9,"y":n:4032230e32fdc961,"causes":[s:"ev:52",],},{"id":n:4075b00000000000,"tick":n:40b9a50000000000,"day":n:4071200000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> tried something with copper and tin — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:4075c00000000000,"tick":n:40b9af0000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Tuva</b> the secret of Eira's the calendar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4075d00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Idun</b> began placing a stone on the grave — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Placing a stone on the grave)</i>","custom":s:"c9","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404ab06ab3ea7b88,"y":n:403c5c5508489715,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4075e00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Idun</b> does it differently: placing a stone on the grave instead of laying flowers on the grave. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c9",},{"id":n:4075f00000000000,"tick":n:40b9b10000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Sten</b> noticed that the yellow metal never dulls and all hands want it. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"goldGleams","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4051f46442ae7396,"y":n:40318b3c437db8f1,},{"id":n:4076000000000000,"tick":n:40b9b50000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔶 <b>Saga</b> poured copper and tin together and woke a hard new metal — <b>Saga's the hard alloy</b> (Bronze) has been invented! <i>The Bronze Age. Tools, blades and bells no stone could match.</i>","tech":s:"bronze","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:4052bfea5cb17ac4,"y":n:4034f1bc152ad117,"causes":[s:"ev:346",s:"ev:68",],},{"id":n:4076100000000000,"tick":n:40b9c00000000000,"day":n:4071300000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Kare</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4028000000000000,},{"id":n:4076200000000000,"tick":n:40b9c40000000000,"day":n:4071400000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4076300000000000,"tick":n:40b9d50000000000,"day":n:4071400000000000,"year":n:4047000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn</b> and <b>Kare</b> have had a child, <b>Sixten</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4034000000000000,"x":n:4048eb76c6e2ba00,"y":n:403367a8d80803d1,"causes":[s:"agent:8",s:"agent:12",],},{"id":n:4076400000000000,"tick":n:40b9e80000000000,"day":n:4071500000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Tuva</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4031000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:4040000000000000,},{"id":n:4076500000000000,"tick":n:40ba080000000000,"day":n:4071600000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:4048e6f2d59f7105,"y":n:4032d23e5b7452f9,},{"id":n:4076600000000000,"tick":n:40ba210000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Alve</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4032000000000000,"x":n:4048cd31b06c8c8c,"y":n:403a8948b6c42837,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4076700000000000,"tick":n:40ba210000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Idun carving a sign into an old tree until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c5",},{"id":n:4076800000000000,"tick":n:40ba210000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Idun placing a stone on the grave until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c9",},{"id":n:4076900000000000,"tick":n:40ba430000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ylva</b> built a hut.","x":n:404b95098b2ad877,"y":n:4040ece1f5351029,},{"id":n:4076a00000000000,"tick":n:40ba430000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ylva</b> was known as <b>Ylva the Founder</b>.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404b95098b2ad877,"y":n:4040ece1f5351029,},{"id":n:4076b00000000000,"tick":n:40ba430000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"village","txt":s:"🏘️ Three huts have become more — <b>Ylvaheim</b> has been founded! A village born of nothing but cooperation.","village":s:"Ylvaheim","x":n:404b95098b2ad877,"y":n:4040ece1f5351029,"causes":[s:"agent:7",],},{"id":n:4076c00000000000,"tick":n:40ba540000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4076d00000000000,"tick":n:40ba590000000000,"day":n:4071a00000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Halvar</b> noticed that fish gather in the shallows. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fishGather","agent":n:402c000000000000,"x":n:404e164669de7761,"y":n:403af889b2ae67cc,},{"id":n:4076e00000000000,"tick":n:40ba700000000000,"day":n:4071b00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Ylvaheim, laying flowers on the grave is now simply what one does. <b>Laying flowers on the grave</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c6","x":n:404b95098b2ad877,"y":n:4040ece1f5351029,},{"id":n:4076f00000000000,"tick":n:40ba710000000000,"day":n:4071b00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Liv the Voice of Runestead</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:403a592b1a540650,"y":n:40114484b4f9ef7e,},{"id":n:4077000000000000,"tick":n:40ba710000000000,"day":n:4071b00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> has begun believing the lights above are the fires of the first people, still watching, the way Sten does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c2",},{"id":n:4077100000000000,"tick":n:40ba880000000000,"day":n:4071c00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Liv</b> worked iron in a coal-hot fire until it took a keener soul — <b>Liv's steelcraft</b> (Steel) has been invented! <i>The hardest working metal — blades, springs, tools that endure.</i>","tech":s:"steel","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:4039fa1d2a64d31d,"y":n:40111a2733febc4b,"causes":[s:"ev:128",s:"ev:72",],},{"id":n:4077200000000000,"tick":n:40ba8a0000000000,"day":n:4071c00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's the calendar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4077300000000000,"tick":n:40baa60000000000,"day":n:4071d00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Tuva</b> the secret of Eira's the net. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:4077400000000000,"tick":n:40bab00000000000,"day":n:4071d00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with gold — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4077500000000000,"tick":n:40badc0000000000,"day":n:4071f00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's pigmentwork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4077600000000000,"tick":n:40badf0000000000,"day":n:4071f00000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Signe</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:403941a5458cc6ba,"y":n:40156a65dea6d6d5,},{"id":n:4077700000000000,"tick":n:40bae40000000000,"day":n:4072000000000000,"year":n:4048000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4077800000000000,"tick":n:40bb000000000000,"day":n:4072100000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Idun</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:40491161802ff198,"y":n:403c4089a848e48f,},{"id":n:4077900000000000,"tick":n:40bb090000000000,"day":n:4072100000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune</b> and <b>Freja</b> have had a child, <b>Maja</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4035000000000000,"x":n:404811371b53fc56,"y":n:4039c746f68b1c6f,"causes":[s:"agent:10",s:"agent:11",],},{"id":n:4077a00000000000,"tick":n:40bb100000000000,"day":n:4072100000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Star-Herd, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:40502aae9861b838,"y":n:40388e8c61879d4a,},{"id":n:4077b00000000000,"tick":n:40bb250000000000,"day":n:4072200000000000,"year":n:4048800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Maja</b> taught <b>Idun</b> the 