y need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:4044a66137ea1d09,"y":n:4037839589e83bce,"causes":[s:"agent:13",],},{"id":n:4078300000000000,"tick":n:40bb900000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Bjorn</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404961bf7427fe5a,"y":n:4033643db6b0ce66,},{"id":n:4078400000000000,"tick":n:40bb9b0000000000,"day":n:4072700000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ylva the Founder</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:4049c6c64d08f274,"y":n:40358b1b8967a5e4,},{"id":n:4078500000000000,"tick":n:40bba30000000000,"day":n:4072800000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva</b> taught <b>Halvar</b> the secret of Eira's burnoven. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:4078600000000000,"tick":n:40bbb80000000000,"day":n:4072800000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Halvar</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:402c000000000000,},{"id":n:4078700000000000,"tick":n:40bbba0000000000,"day":n:4072900000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪙 <b>Sten</b> stamped a fixed weight of metal all agreed to trust — <b>Sten's the coin</b> (Coinage) has been invented! <i>Money — value made portable; markets and wealth take shape.</i>","tech":s:"coinage","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404de33d34c48dce,"y":n:4032f44e1c146c96,"causes":[s:"ev:132",s:"ev:77",],},{"id":n:4078800000000000,"tick":n:40bbd10000000000,"day":n:4072900000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Idun</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:402a000000000000,},{"id":n:4078900000000000,"tick":n:40bbda0000000000,"day":n:4072a00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Eira's clearstone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:4078a00000000000,"tick":n:40bc040000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4078b00000000000,"tick":n:40bc180000000000,"day":n:4072c00000000000,"year":n:4049000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> tried something with sand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:4078c00000000000,"tick":n:40bc200000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4078d00000000000,"tick":n:40bc200000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Rune the Founder</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404f7417e9e4e92e,"y":n:403a73ab8d5df885,},{"id":n:4078e00000000000,"tick":n:40bc270000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare</b> and <b>Bjorn</b> have had a child, <b>Loke</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4036000000000000,"x":n:4049dd86dd7ca164,"y":n:4035b822b4c88c68,"causes":[s:"agent:12",s:"agent:8",],},{"id":n:4078f00000000000,"tick":n:40bc270000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Loke</b> the secret of Eira's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4079000000000000,"tick":n:40bc2e0000000000,"day":n:4072d00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Saga</b> built a hut.","x":n:405585909de2c916,"y":n:4026d9e6d4911ea0,},{"id":n:4079100000000000,"tick":n:40bc340000000000,"day":n:4072e00000000000,"year":n:4049800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Maja</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with th