e people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:404abfdc6d855fa2,"y":n:4035a1b6aeaee63d,},{"id":n:4079a00000000000,"tick":n:40bcc20000000000,"day":n:4073400000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Signe</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:403a6a9d9763e368,"y":n:402e9c12b3e6907b,},{"id":n:4079b00000000000,"tick":n:40bcda0000000000,"day":n:4073500000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Eira's the mason. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:4079c00000000000,"tick":n:40bcf80000000000,"day":n:4073600000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⏳ <b>Saga</b> tamed a falling weight into steady, counted time — <b>Saga's the escapement</b> (Mechanical clock) has been invented! <i>Time itself measured — the first true machine.</i>","tech":s:"clock","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:4054255a957f065f,"y":n:4038ae05fbaaf715,"causes":[s:"ev:384",s:"ev:86",],},{"id":n:4079d00000000000,"tick":n:40bd1f0000000000,"day":n:4073700000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Kare</b> brings in the harvest from Kare's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:404b000000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:4079e00000000000,"tick":n:40bd240000000000,"day":n:4073800000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4079f00000000000,"tick":n:40bd360000000000,"day":n:4073800000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun</b> taught <b>Loke</b> the secret of Eira's birchbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:407a000000000000,"tick":n:40bd400000000000,"day":n:4073900000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Rune</b> carries a stick everywhere. It is never used for anything. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:40489aa77f7939e7,"y":n:403af35810eed6de,},{"id":n:407a100000000000,"tick":n:40bd420000000000,"day":n:4073900000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Eira's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:407a200000000000,"tick":n:40bd610000000000,"day":n:4073a00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> tried something with iron and wood — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:402c000000000000,},{"id":n:407a300000000000,"tick":n:40bdb40000000000,"day":n:4073e00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:407a400000000000,"tick":n:40bdc80000000000,"day":n:4073e00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"conversion","txt":s:"<b>Kare</b> has left Laying flowers on the grave for Placing a stone on the grave. Minds change; so do worlds.","custom":s:"c9","from":s:"c6",},{"id":n:407a500000000000,"tick":n:40bdd00000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:407a600000000000,"tick":n:40bdd00000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Runestead, laying flowers on the grave is now simply what one does. <b>Laying flowers on the grave</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c6","x":n:404508bffc27c567,"y":n:403fd3e334bd317b,},{"id":n:407a700000000000,"tick":n:40bdd10000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Torv the Ironhand</b> died of old age at 70. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404a5aaac74f4168,"y":n:4030ecf5c4fa435d,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:407a800000000000,"